  "title": "Destination: Disney Imagination Campus - Walt Disney World Youth Educational Programs",
  "date": "2024-10-13T03:15:31.622Z",
  "description": "Embark on a magical educational journey with Disney Youth Programs at Walt Disney World. Inspire the next generation of leaders and artists!",
  "heroImage": {
    "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_24d5bb07ee044545b583fa82189758ef~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_675,al_c,q_90/file.jpg",
    "alt": "Destination: Disney Imagination Campus - Walt Disney World Youth Educational Programs"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "In August of 2024, reunited Mouseketeers hosted bright young creatives on a once-in-a-lifetime learning adventure behind the scenes at Walt Disney World Resort. The trip was part of Always In The Club Foundation's campaign to introduce 1,000 children to what Disney calls imagination-powered learning - <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/destination-disney\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><u>Our Destination: Disney Imagination Campus</u></strong></a>!"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<strong>Disney Imagination Campus</strong> is a comprehensive collection of workshops covering a range of performing arts and academic subjects. Our first trip featured the workshops LEADERSHIP - THE DISNEY WAY and DISNEY BROADWAY MAGIC \"FROZEN.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The experiential learning adventure was led by Mouseketeer mentors who provided additional guidance and insights for our young artists and future leaders."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The trip was sponsored by <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://begreatshow.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><u>Be Great!</u></strong></a> and coordinated by our partners at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.educationaldestinations.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><u>Educational Destinations</u></strong></a> (a Disney PremEAR student travel planner)."
    },
